cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BlastRadius or the BR-Bench dataset, please cite it as below."
title: "BlastRadius and BR-Bench: execution-grounded change impact data from GitHub Actions"
abstract: >-
  BR-Bench links code changes in GitHub Actions runs to the individual tests
  that actually failed because of them, using a deterministic pipeline that
  resolves a base run for every change and filters same-commit flakiness.
type: software
